# Optional. If set, the chat widget (Maya) uses real Claude responses via
# app/api/chat/route.ts. If left unset, the widget still works using the
# rule-based fallback in lib/chatResponses.ts - no functionality is broken
# either way.
#
# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your own key. Get one at
# https://console.anthropic.com
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
